graph TD
    START([User visits app]) --> CHECK{Has stored<br>JWT token?}

    CHECK -->|Yes| VERIFY[AuthContext calls<br>GET /api/v1/auth/me]
    CHECK -->|No| SHOW_PUBLIC[Show public pages<br>Dashboard, Cards, Movers]

    VERIFY -->|Valid| AUTHED[User authenticated<br>Show full nav]
    VERIFY -->|Invalid/expired| CLEAR[Clear tokens<br>Show public pages]

    SHOW_PUBLIC --> CLICK_PROTECTED{User clicks<br>protected route?}
    CLEAR --> CLICK_PROTECTED

    CLICK_PROTECTED -->|Yes| REDIRECT[ProtectedRoute<br>redirects to /login]
    CLICK_PROTECTED -->|No| BROWSE[Browse public pages]

    REDIRECT --> LOGIN_PAGE[Login Page]
    LOGIN_PAGE --> CHOOSE{Sign in or<br>Create account?}

    CHOOSE -->|Sign in| LOGIN[POST /api/v1/auth/login<br>email + password]
    CHOOSE -->|Create account| REGISTER[POST /api/v1/auth/register<br>email + password]

    LOGIN -->|Success| STORE_TOKENS[Store JWT tokens<br>in localStorage]
    LOGIN -->|Failure| SHOW_ERROR[Show error message]
    REGISTER -->|Success| STORE_TOKENS
    REGISTER -->|Failure| SHOW_ERROR

    SHOW_ERROR --> LOGIN_PAGE

    STORE_TOKENS --> FETCH_ME[GET /api/v1/auth/me]
    FETCH_ME --> AUTHED

    AUTHED --> ACCESS[Access collection,<br>scans, all features]

    ACCESS --> LOGOUT{User clicks<br>Sign out?}
    LOGOUT -->|Yes| CLEAR_SESSION[POST /api/v1/auth/logout<br>Clear tokens]
    CLEAR_SESSION --> SHOW_PUBLIC
